{"3669700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SUBROUTINE", "steam_appid": 3669700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669700/extras/ad94d7058458c331af1558face90ccb6.poster.avif?t=1772447395\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669700/extras/ad94d7058458c331af1558face90ccb6.webm?t=1772447395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669700/extras/ad94d7058458c331af1558face90ccb6.mp4?t=1772447395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOB OPENING: ROBOT INSPECTOR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a robot inspector at an automated robot assembly plant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The central AI has started producing killer robots with the ability to impersonate our harmless worker bots in a bid to escape the factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to manually verify each outgoing unit to ensure you don't accidentally ship a killer robot to a client.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single mistake can have serious consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669700/extras/589dc693f6315065545309b1f34b7ee6.poster.avif?t=1772447395\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669700/extras/589dc693f6315065545309b1f34b7ee6.webm?t=1772447395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669700/extras/589dc693f6315065545309b1f34b7ee6.mp4?t=1772447395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robot Inspection Routine: Inspect appearance, behaviour and documentation to assess which robots are good to go and which ones are killer robots in disguise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth Gameplay: Navigate the facility and make use of hiding spaces and distractions to avoid being spotted when hunted by killer robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lore: Explore hidden transmits in the server logs uncovering the sinister truth behind the facility.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669700/extras/ad94d7058458c331af1558face90ccb6.poster.avif?t=1772447395\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669700/extras/ad94d7058458c331af1558face90ccb6.webm?t=1772447395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669700/extras/ad94d7058458c331af1558face90ccb6.mp4?t=1772447395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOB OPENING: ROBOT INSPECTOR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a robot inspector at an automated robot assembly plant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The central AI has started producing killer robots with the ability to impersonate our harmless worker bots in a bid to escape the factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to manually verify each outgoing unit to ensure you don't accidentally ship a killer robot to a client.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single mistake can have serious consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"